6) /public/privacy.html
----------------------------------
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Privacy Policy • ENAM Solutions Company LLC</title>
  <style>body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Inter,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a}main{max-width:800px;margin:8vh auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(2,6,23,.06)}h1{margin-top:0}code{background:#f1f5f9;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px}</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>ENAM Solutions Company LLC</strong><br/>4835 Mead Street, Dearborn, MI 48126, USA<br/>Contact: <a href="mailto:Tarmosh@yahoo.com">Tarmosh@yahoo.com</a></p>
  <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> <span id="d"></span></p>
  <script>document.getElementById('d').textContent=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)</script>
  <h2>Scope</h2>
  <p>This Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard personal information obtained through our website and services. We serve clients in the United States and worldwide.</p>
  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact data</strong> (name, email, phone, company) submitted via forms.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data</strong> (IP address, device/browser details) for security and site functionality.</li>
    <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell personal information.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to inquiries and provide services.</li>
    <li>To secure, monitor, and improve our website.</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations and enforce agreements.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Legal Bases & Choices</h2>
  <p>We process data based on consent, performance of a contract, and legitimate interests (security, quality). You may request access, correction, deletion, or restriction by emailing us. We will verify identity before fulfilling requests.</p>
  <h2>Data Security</h2>
  <p>We use TLS/HTTPS, access controls, and reasonable safeguards. No system is 100% secure; we maintain incident response procedures and will notify as required by applicable law.</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain data only as long as necessary for the purposes above or as required by law.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Our site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>
  <h2>International Visitors</h2>
  <p>Your information may be processed in the United States. By using our site, you consent to transfer and processing according to this Policy.</p>
  <h2>Third Parties</h2>
  <p>We may use service providers (e.g., hosting, email delivery). They access data only to perform services on our behalf under confidentiality obligations.</p>
  <h2>Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, delete, or opt out of certain processing. Contact us to exercise rights.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:Tarmosh@yahoo.com">Tarmosh@yahoo.com</a></p>
  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>We may change this Policy; material changes will be posted here with a new effective date.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>

