  <h2>Measures</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic HTML, ARIA labels, and keyboard navigation.</li>
    <li>Sufficient color contrast and text alternatives for images.</li>
    <li>Skip‑to‑content link and focus styles.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>If you encounter accessibility barriers, contact us at <a href="mailto:Tarmosh@yahoo.com">Tarmosh@yahoo.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+13136524557">(313) 652‑4557</a>.</p>
